{
  "id": "training_object_permanence_world_models",
  "title": "Teaching AI How Things Stay Real",
  "category": "benchmark_news",
  "domain_taxonomy": "quantitative_benchmark",
  "hook_tag": "BENCHMARK NEWS",
  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "Why do some AI models struggle to track a hidden toy? They often forget objects exist once they move out of view.",
      "visual_focus": "A toy block slides behind a wall and disappears, confusing a simple AI wireframe.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "forget": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "World Model",
        "action_verb": "fails",
        "direct_object": "object tracking",
        "anchor_word": "forget",
        "semantic_role": "causal_elimination"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "Think of it like a baby playing peek-a-boo. If they cannot see the face, they think the person has truly left the room.",
      "visual_focus": "A split screen showing a baby reacting to a covered face and an AI logic loop.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "peek-a-boo": "#38BDF8"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Cognitive Prior",
        "action_verb": "models",
        "direct_object": "hidden state",
        "anchor_word": "peek-a-boo",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "Scientists built a massive database with ten thousand puzzles. Each one forces the AI to track items despite changes in lighting or speed.",
      "visual_focus": "A library grid filling with thousands of colorful, distinct physical puzzles.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "database": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Data Infrastructure",
        "action_verb": "scales",
        "direct_object": "cognitive training samples",
        "anchor_word": "database",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "The model learns to map the world by watching these clips. It carves out deep rules for how objects bump, hide, and return.",
      "visual_focus": "A marble statue being chiseled away to reveal a moving ball and wall geometry.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "deep rules": "#F59E0B"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Training Engine",
        "action_verb": "optimizes",
        "direct_object": "latent physical priors",
        "anchor_word": "rules",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "The new model, PWM, now ranks as a top performer. It beats older, simpler systems at keeping track of things in the dark.",
      "visual_focus": "A leaderboard glowing as the PWM model jumps to the number one spot.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "top performer": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "PWM Model",
        "action_verb": "outranks",
        "direct_object": "baseline video models",
        "anchor_word": "performer",
        "semantic_role": "metric_evaluation"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 6,
      "text": "Follow The Model Verse for simple explanations of how modern AI actually works.",
      "visual_focus": "The Model Verse logo appears over a clean, pulsing neural graph.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "The Model Verse": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Viewer",
        "action_verb": "joins",
        "direct_object": "The Model Verse",
        "anchor_word": "Follow",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    }
  ],
